    "5782505bab228d3045f8fa6cce086fc6f84445869d6cc8b645685a05258b7f35": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "3a2398d50d192a337d56f4ad5cddf358777da9211336b9f642039e1cf69c303b",
      "contextFingerprint": "0f26f44a34055a4ff3ab6c6c8422e4b2d2c55b2057921e3dbf6f92428d445297",
      "sourceText": "2.  选择接口(Interface)\n\n    1.  原因：FreeRTOS遵循ARM的CMSIS标准。\n\n    2.  选择原则：优先选CMSIS v1，因为CMSIS v2还有些小问题没解决。\n\n    3.  如何选择？\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image246.webp)\n\n3.  配置Include Parameters\n\n    1.  功能：与hal_conf.h(用来开启HAL库的一些功能)一样，用来开启FreeRTOS的一些功能。\n\n    2.  Include Parameters的配置\n\n        1.  CubeMX配置(推荐)\n\n        2.  需要什么功能就Enabled对应的功能即可。（常用的就是vTaskDelayUntil）\n\n        ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image247.webp)\n\n        4.  手动编辑头文件配置(不推荐)",
      "translatedText": "2.  Select the Interface\n\n    1.  Reason: FreeRTOS follows ARM's CMSIS standard\\.\n\n    2.  Selection principle: Prefer CMSIS v1, because CMSIS v2 still has some minor unresolved issues\\.\n\n    3.  How to choose?\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image246.webp)\n\n3.  Configure Include Parameters\n\n    1.  Function: Same as hal_conf.h (used to enable certain features of the HAL library), used to enable certain features of FreeRTOS\\.\n\n    2.  Configuration of Include Parameters\n\n        1.  CubeMX configuration (recommended)\n\n        2.  Simply enable the corresponding feature as needed\\. (The commonly used one is vTaskDelayUntil\\.)\n\n        ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image247.webp)\n\n        4.  Manual header file editing configuration (not recommended)",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 249,
        "outputTokens": 134,
        "costUsd": 0.000236
      }
    },
